      "cause": "The extra English width comes partly from reducing Chinese to 105px and Japanese to 134px. Arabic remains narrow at 110px."
    },
    {
      "design": "r1C",
      "good": "The 120px Chinese column keeps the cart message on one line and the error to two lines. The key column is intact, and Japanese has slightly more room than in the other designs.",
